<title>ROMANIA: Bucharest first-tier stocks push turnover higher.</title>
<headline>Bucharest first-tier stocks push turnover higher.</headline>
<text>
<p>1300 GMT - Heavy trading in first-tier fertiliser maker Azomures and Oltchim chemical plant increased Bucharest bourse turnover by 1.0 billion lei to 2.2 billion on Tuesday.</p>
<p>* Azomures took 52 percent of turnover, inching 10 lei higher to a 1,630 close.</p>
<p>* Oltchim followed right behind, with 921.4 million lei in turnover. It closed 20 lei weaker at 1,630 under selling pressure.</p>
<p>* Engineer Artrom and Carbid-Fox carbide producer absorbed some of the session's buying interest, with turnover levels of 25.9 million lei and respectively 35.6 million.</p>
<p>* Almost all prices climbed in low supply.  </p>
